{"id":2201,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>中北大学85周年之际，海内外校友奔赴母校之约，重回故园、重温韶华。我院2005级工程力学专业优秀校友王鹏飞暖心捐赠壹佰万元整，为母校华诞献礼。</p><p>2026年5月18日，中北大学航空宇航学院特聘教授聘任暨“海问·探知”奖学金捐赠仪式在学院314会议室隆重举行。优秀校友王鹏飞、中北大学副校长杨风暴，教育发展基金会理事长薛实军，国内交流合作部部长张胜利，航空宇航学院党委书记罗建国等领导和航空宇航学院全体辅导员出席，仪式由学院副书记张丽花主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUlQQ7ozVkMNVfLqmMkU8LZMRTfM4Qp7LlLDnmGsM4r2UmU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8LkyDn1y4L8rVolCsoRGbMR9sMRfRU4-bnln7UN-iMlrFM87sMmCbo7rFM778nmvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F406F33EE9F780948740CC29EDDBB55E/7A76698E/4A4F7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CnRrQkLRlsLRCZUqzA7oR98L4LiLRlpDU87ZoRnfol74LzL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkMShVMkhfnR-YM7WkLl-iMl7PUz94MzlZUzLPnlU8oRTFMR9ZU4-sUmnFM4V2L4TVgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"></p><p>仪式上，薛实军理事长、张胜利部长先后致辞，对王鹏飞校友心系母校、助力学院发展的善举表示感谢，高度肯定了他深耕新材料领域取得的突出成就，以及对母校教育事业的深情回馈。随后，罗建国书记为王鹏飞校友颁发航空宇航学院特聘教授聘书，正式聘任其为学院特聘教授，杨风暴副校长、薛实军理事长与王鹏飞校友共同启动“海问·探知”奖学金捐赠仪式。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Cn7lQbMlCZUmTVLq7QVMRQ7ozfVLlQpRL7LiMNC4Lznfoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0USysM1ysU1hRM49ZnNV7nzUio7CPLR9sM4ARL47aLz7bL7nFolM7M4rVMzMFMRQ2nm9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A767BC788FADE458F108778C3101190D/9CD75E53/46FF8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Cn7UQDU4GYLz-ZoqzTkLzU8LmMRM7WpfnlUYL4nVnzCbLzU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8U1hkokhfMRlPnRCbU4UYLmnVozVfLmLiUN-Pnm67U8WFMl-aM8WkLlrFoznfollPgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUm6QVLlVRLllsnqmAfM49aUNLbnNrp2oRAfUzQ7n77bLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyPnky4LYy4nznfoRUsL462nmNiUl-PnlnVoRUinRr2nlVFMzUYLRvbn7WFL8V7U4-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/71D333E4A84737FF95AB1EDE845D5FEA/542079DB/3ADC2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CMlUQ4U8lPnRGPLql78nmWfLzGDo7Qp2M7n2MmL4nNU4MN-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVM1h2nSyiMlQfUzVRnRM7U4liMR7ao7r7nR7inRGiUlVFLmfRoRfkLNrFM4NiM4-sgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUNCQZMm62MRnRUqz9sL8WRMmviMzMpfUmNDoR98MzU8L8U0gihFp2hmCIa0oShfUSysoShfLz-iUznfLzvbLzvsU8Canm7DM4LYnz-aLlnFo7LYMRl4L4MFMRV7UllJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9AA79A125A4A179177CF0F16732E201D/8C245333/41DAE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CnzvQDUmv8n7WkLqlU4nm78nR74ozlpaUm6fUlCYLmCinl70gihFp2hmCIa0LYhkUYhVU1hVnz98UzLPU8W7nRlsL7CDnRN4oRUbU4violnFMR6VLmN4oRWFoRAkM7-sgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUz9QYLRNZoRCZMqRVfL7MfL4LanNLpsL4-YL77YUlCiMRN0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyaM1ysUYy8MzL4MlUPnm-bU8CPU8-sMmNPLlrVMzT7ozQFL8UaUmWkMzTFMRUaUzUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1067C45335D1F29CF1CB76911EE59D96/3D0B2B59/440A4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CL4MQ7LlW7M8UPMqmGaMRUYUlLsoRCpDLRA7Lz-PozQVM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8L1y4L1yZL87DMmQRLlWVUN74nR7bL4LaMm9PUNnVL7rFMlrVLzV2LmAFolQ7nRM7gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"></p><p>王鹏飞校友是中北大学2005级工程力学专业优秀毕业生，现任诸暨海问新材料科技有限公司董事长。他在发言中深情回顾了在母校求学的难忘时光，对老师们的悉心培养与母校的教育平台表示由衷感谢，并表示此次受聘与捐赠，既是一份荣誉，更是一份责任。未来他将积极履行特聘教授职责，推动校企协同育人，同时也希望通过奖学金激励更多学弟学妹们勤学善思、勇于探索，在航空航天等领域勇攀高峰，为国家科技事业贡献青春力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CU4VQkolL4UzAkMql7YLNQVMRMVozTpVo7rfM7MRUN7DL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDokyaoSysMlCDM46RoRMfo7-Zn7UPUmlDU4lDLR62L7VFL49YU4nRLzAFL8lsnl7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8680975F677C83A8B8DD1B56C5607F0A/382C4C18/3E7EA\" vheight=\" 249px\" vwidth=\" 400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CMzCQZUmL8UzUDMq8LiM4VVnmV7MmGpYU4l4LzN8UNM7UzG0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYLSyaM1hkM4lPLlMRM77PnmQ7n7UsM8l4MmV2oz6RLzfFnmU8LmVkLzTFMm9DLzGsgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CnNLQbM4G8ozr7Lqz7bLN-Zn7LDMm6p7oRVRUmQknmNPM4L0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2U1y4okyZUmG4UNCDUNn2L4-YLzlZM4v4nNrVM7UanRnFMzMVoz7aUmWFLz-YU87DgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0FB388B03BF6BDF322158773FEE4D0D4/53E910B2/122CA6\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CnzTQVnlrRMz9bMqNW2MRUbLz98M7lpiLNUsMRl4Mz9aozv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhknSyiUSh7oRrknNQkozUDLmLbo77sM8CZUNUinmTkL4WFL77anRAkMzrFL8-YL4lbgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.png\"></p><p>杨风暴副校长作总结发言，他代表学校对王鹏飞校友的慷慨捐赠表示诚挚感谢，对他的事业成就和反哺母校的情怀表示赞赏。他指出，2026年是学校“双一流”创建的关键之年，王鹏飞校友深耕深海项目材料领域的成就与“海问·探知”奖学金的设立，既是对学校办学成果的肯定，也将极大鼓舞中北学子勇攀高峰；学校也将进一步思考如何为校友发展提供支持，深化校企合作，助力学校“双一流”建设与人才培养。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CnRnQknRrfnN-sMqzvZMmliU4TfUNCpPn7W7M7LZoRGsMRL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyiM1hRM1yZU4M2nRGYL4-bL4CDM8VfUzT7MlUinz9YLm6FM4nVUmlbozQFM7UYL7-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/856C68C3FD023293667AAA9D5D5E8227/74EB5996/4D20B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Cnm9QPLRUDMRWRoqz-ioR-DnmNiLmTp7MRLsU8VRL4TfMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVMYhkokyYM8LPnl-4L8M7MlC4nRviMNrRLR9ZnmLDM7MFLlQ7M8MVolnFM4lbLRLagtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRLYMYbw62v8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次仪式的成功举办，搭建了校友与母校之间的连心桥，也为航空宇航学院的学科建设与人才培养注入了新的动力。未来，学院将以此次活动为契机，继续书写学院发展的新的篇章，为中北大学再创辉煌、争创双一流贡献航空的力量！</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=CUlQQ7ozVkMNVfLqmMkU8LZMRTfM4Qp7LlLDnmGsM4r2UmU0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8LkyDn1y4L8rVolCsoRGbMR9sMRfRU4-bnln7UN-iMlrFM87sMmCbo7rFM778nmvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aL4-sgtA8pUvcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10327&e=.jpg"}